        {
          "type": "topic-map",
          "html": "<p>Your data lives in two places. <b>Out there</b>: profiles that apps, websites and <b>data brokers</b> build about you and sell to advertisers, landlords, employers or anyone who pays. <b>With you</b>: the photos, documents and messages on your phone, laptop, USB sticks and cloud accounts.</p>"
